stateDiagram-v2
  working --> quiescing: safe work boundary
  quiescing --> sleeping: durable state and no actionable work
  sleeping --> wake_pending: durable task or obligation
  wake_pending --> working: revalidate policy budget epoch capacity
  sleeping --> paused: management or authorization
  wake_pending --> paused: pause overrides wake
  paused --> wake_pending: explicit resume and pending work
  wake_pending --> waiting_quota: no approved capacity
  waiting_quota --> wake_pending: approved quota recheck
